{"3199470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Knuckle Jet","steam_appid":3199470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>► Jet-fueled knuckle acrobatics!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientifically inaccurate flight action that rewards high-speed momentum and precision. Feel free to completely ignore G-force in the name of awesomeness, and keep smashing, crashing and crushing to stay in the flow!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3199470\/extras\/4df01d43a78eca47f20797ecd14eeba8.poster.avif?t=1790869588\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3199470\/extras\/4df01d43a78eca47f20797ecd14eeba8.webm?t=1790869588\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>► Non-stop arcade action!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of standalone levels  packed to bursting with  mechanical foes to punch. Anastasia stands at the ready to give them all a knuckle (jet) sandwich. Utilize your environment, find hidden collectibles, and chase perfection!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3199470\/extras\/db6dc28b3f4c82d4bdccc23cbdb9ebd2.poster.avif?t=1790869588\" width=660 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3199470\/extras\/db6dc28b3f4c82d4bdccc23cbdb9ebd2.webm?t=1790869588\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3199470\/